abstract: "v1.0.0 (12 November 2026). DFT and experimental tables are separate. Includes canonical-composition keys, proposed leakage-safe splits, own-paper exclusions and CPU reference and tuned baselines. Raw Starrydata curves and points are not redistributed. A ChemRxiv preprint is available (DOI 10.26434/chemrxiv.15011944)."
